🇺🇸What's Behind Trump's Recent "Moon" Rant? 

▪️Much of what the US president says, regardless of administration, is to distract the global public from continuity of agenda and how its advances special interests at the expense of the rest of the planet - however - sometimes these are topics being introduced to the public for a reason; 

▪️The Moon sits atop the Earth's gravity well, making it a "high ground" for orbital warfare and orbital-to-surface combat; 

▪️It creates a base from which to launch anti-satellite systems as well as kinetic kill vehicles toward the Earth's surface from bases incredibly difficult for missiles and rockets on Earth to strike back against; 

▪️Controlling the Moon would allow the US to deny China the ability to develop its Earth-Moon economic zone - a Chinese achievement that would indefinitely prevent the US from ever undermining China and reasserting US hegemony again;  

▪️The US, China, and Russia all have anti-satellite missiles, jamming capabilities, and "inspector satellites" that can approach, jam, or even grapple adversary satellites - extending this arms race to the Moon at the top of the Earth's gravity well, is the natural next step this propaganda is attempting to prepare the public for;
